msgid "Add fermionic transitions to the pool of configurations for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng mga fermionic transition sa pool ng mga configuration para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add fermionic transitions to the pool of configurations"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng mga fermionic transition sa pool ng mga configuration"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/add-fermionic-excitations-to-configuration-pool.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we demonstrate the functionalities to augment the pool of electronic\n"
"configurations obtained by the action of transition operators on each electronic\n"
"configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito ipinapakita namin ang mga functionality para palawakin ang pool ng mga electronic\n"
"configuration na nakukuha mula sa aksyon ng mga transition operator sa bawat electronic\n"
"configuration.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We demonstrate how to add single-electron hops of the type:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"for $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ and $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"and for all $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ in the batch of electronic configurations.\n"
"We start by generating a batch of random electronic configurations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita namin kung paano magdagdag ng single-electron hop ng uri:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"para sa $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ at $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"at para sa lahat ng $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ sa batch ng mga electronic configuration.\n"
"Sisimulan natin sa pag-generate ng batch ng mga random na electronic configuration:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The excitation operators are specified inside a numpy array whose length is\n"
"equal to the number of fermionic nodes (or qubits). Each element of the array\n"
"must be a string that can take values:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga excitation operator ay tinutukoy sa loob ng isang numpy array na ang haba ay\n"
"pareho sa bilang ng mga fermionic node (o qubit). Ang bawat elemento ng array\n"
"ay dapat isang string na maaaring magkaroon ng mga halagang:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'I'``: Identity\n"
msgstr "``'I'``: Identity\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'+'``: Creation operator\n"
msgstr "``'+'``: Operator ng paglikha\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'-'``: Annihilation operator\n"
msgstr "``'-'``: Operator ng pagpuksa\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We generate all possible single-electron transitions (amongst same spin\n"
"species).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagawa namin ang lahat ng posibleng single-electron transition (sa pagitan ng parehong spin\n"
"species).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we apply the transition operators to the configurations in ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, ina-apply natin ang mga transition operator sa mga configuration sa ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
